    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ERIN: Are you okay?\nKAYLA: Just fine. How are you?",
      "ERIN: Who are you?\nKAYLA: Just your friendly neighborhood bank robbers.",
      "KAYLA: You look nervous there sweetheart.\nERIN: Funny, so do you.",
      "KAYLA: You know, some of us don't have the luck of being born or married into money. So we look for the only other way to get it.\nERIN: You think somebody owes you?\nKAYLA: Honey, we all think somebody owes us. I can look at you in two minutes and tell you think somebosy owes you something. It may not be cash...…\nERIN: You have any idea where your going Davy Crockett?",
      "KAYLA: I always hated those well to do snobs that think life is going to always be there just for them. Well, guess what? No one owes you nothing!\nERIN: You don't even know me bitch!"
    ]
  },
